    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegiddii Axiiyaah Ee Ka Geesta Ahayd Yaaraabcaam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waagaas ayaa Abiiyaah oo ahaa ina Yaaraabcaam bukooday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yaaraabcaam wuxuu bilcantiisii ku yidhi, Waan ku baryayaaye, kac oo isbeddel, oo yaan lagu aqoon inaad tahay bilcantii Yaaraabcaam; oo waxaad tagtaa Shiiloh, waayo, halkaas waxaa jooga Nebi Axiiyaah oo ii sheegay inaan dadkan boqor u ahaanayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad qaaddaa toban xabbadood oo kibis ah, iyo buskuddo, iyo ubbo malab ah, oo isaga u tag; oo wuxuu kuu sheegi doonaa waxa wiilka ku dhici doona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yaaraabcaam bilcantiisiina sidaasay yeeshay, oo waxay u kacday Shiiloh oo gurigii Axiiyaah bay timid. Haddaba Axiiyaah waxba ma arki karin, waayo, indhihiisii waxay la dhaceen dugow aawadiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu wuxuu Axiiyaah ku yidhi, Bal eeg, Yaaraabcaam bilcantiisii ayaa kuugu imanaysa inay ku weyddiiso wax ku saabsan wiilkeeda, maxaa yeelay, isagu wuu bukaa; haddaba iyada saas iyo saas ku dheh; waayo, markay kuu timaado waxay iska dhigaysaa naag kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii Axiiyaah maqlay sanqadhii cagaheeda, markii ay albaabka soo gashay ayuu ku yidhi, Soo gal, Yaaraabcaam bilcantiisay, maxaadse isaga dhigaysaa mid kale? Waayo, waxaa la iigu soo kaa dhiibay war xun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba tag, oo Yaaraabcaam waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu leeyahay, Anigu dadka oo dhan waan kaa sara mariyey, oo waxaan amiir kaaga dhigay dadkaygii Israa'iil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo boqortooyadiina intaan reerkii Daa'uud ka soo xoogay ayaan ku siiyey, oo weliba ma aadan ahaan sidii addoonkaygii Daa'uud, kii amarradaydii xajiyey, oo qalbigiisa oo dhanna igu raacay inuu sameeyo wixii hortayda ku qummanaa oo keliya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse waxaad samaysay shar ka sii badan kii intii kaa horraysay oo dhan, oo waxaad samaysatay ilaahyo kale iyo sanamyo la shubay, waanad iga xanaajisay, oo waxaad igu tuurtay gadaashaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed, bal ogow, shar baan ku soo dejin doonaa reer Yaaraabcaam, oo Yaaraabcaam waxaan ka baabbi'in doonaa wiil kasta, ha ahaado mid kasta oo dalka Israa'iil ku dhex xidhan ama mid kasta oo ku dhex furan, oo reer Yaaraabcaam oo dhanna waan xaaqi doonaa ilaa uu wada baabbo'o sida digo dibadda loogu xaaqo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yaaraabcaam dadkiisa kii magaalada kaga dhinta waxaa cuni doona eeyaha, oo kii duurka kaga dhintana waxaa cuni doona haadka samada, waayo, Rabbigu saasuu ku hadlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba kac, oo gurigaaga tag, oo mar alla markay cagahaagu magaalada galaan ayuu wiilkii dhiman doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadka dalka Israa'iil oo dhan ayaa u barooran doona oo aasi doona, waayo, dadka Yaaraabcaam oo dhan isaga keliya ayaa xabaasha gelaya, maxaa yeelay, reer Yaaraabcaam isaga keliya ayaa laga helay wax ku wanaagsan xagga Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Rabbigu wuxuu sara kicin doonaa boqor u taliya dadkii Israa'iil, oo kaasuna maalintaas wuxuu baabbi'in doonaa reer Yaaraabcaam, laakiinse taasu waa goorma? Waa haddeer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu dadkii Israa'iil u layn doonaa sida cawsduur biyo ugu ruxmado, oo dadkii Israa'iil wuu ka rujin doonaa dalkan wanaagsan oo uu siiyey awowayaashood, oo wuxuu ku firdhin doonaa Webiga shishadiisa, maxaa yeelay, waxay samaysteen geedihii Asheeraah, oo Rabbigana saasay uga xanaajiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu dadka dalka Israa'iil u sii daynayaa dembiyadii Yaaraabcaam dembaabay oo uu dadka dalka Israa'iilna dembaajiyey aawadood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Yaaraabcaam bilcantiisii kacday oo tagtay, oo waxay timid Tirsaah; oo markay guriga iriddiisii soo gaadhay ayaa wiilkii dhintay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii dalka Israa'iil oo dhammu way aaseen, wayna u wada baroorteen siduu ahaa eraygii Rabbigu ku hadlay ee uu nebigii ahaa addoonkiisii Axiiyaah u soo dhiibay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yaaraabcaam falimihiisii kale ee ku saabsanaa siduu u diriray, iyo siduu u talin jiray, waxay ku qoran yihiin kitaabka taariikhda boqorradii dalka Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yaaraabcaamna wuxuu talinayay laba iyo labaatan sannadood; markaasuu dhintay oo awowayaashiis la seexday, oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday wiilkiisii Naadaab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rexabcaam, Boqorkii Dalka Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rexabcaam ina Sulaymaanna boqor buu ka ahaa dalka Yahuudah. Oo markuu Rexabcaam boqor noqday wuxuu jiray kow iyo afartan sannadood, oo toddoba iyo toban sannadood ayuu boqor ku ahaa Yeruusaalem oo ahayd magaaladii Rabbigu ka doortay qabiilooyinkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan inuu magiciisa halkaas dhigo. Oo hooyadiis magaceeduna wuxuu ahaa Nacamaah tii reer Cammoon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Yahuudahna waxay sameeyeen wax Rabbiga hortiisa shar ku ah, oo waxay Rabbiga kaga hinaasiyeen dembiyadoodii ay galeen oo ka badnaa kuwii ay awowayaashood galeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, waxay buur kasta oo dheer dusheed iyo geed kasta oo dheer oo doog ah hoostiis ka dhisteen meelo sarsare, iyo tiirar, iyo geedo Asheeraah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba dalka waxaa joogay makhnuudyo, oo waxay u wada sameeyeen sidii kulli karaahiyadii ay samayn jireen quruumihii Rabbigu ka eryay reer binu Israa'iil hortooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sannaddii shanaad oo Boqor Rexabcaam ayaa Shiishaq oo boqorkii Masar ahaa Yeruusaalem ku kacay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo wuxuu qaatay khasnadihii guriga Rabbiga iyo khasnadihii guriga boqorka, oo dhammaantood wuu wada qaatay; oo wuxuu kaloo wada qaatay gaashaammadii dahabka ahaa oo Sulaymaan sameeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Boqor Rexabcaam ayaa meeshoodii ka sameeyey gaashaammo naxaas ah, oo wuxuu u dhiibay saraakiishii waardiyayaashii albaabkii guriga boqorka dhawri jiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo mar alla markii boqorku gurigii Rabbiga galo ayay waardiyayaashu gaashaammada qaadi jireen, oo haddana waxay ku soo celin jireen qolkii waardiyayaasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
